---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import TopBar from '../components/TopBar.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = '10 May 2026';
const businessEmail = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BUSINESS_EMAIL || 'contact@shritaxi.com';
const businessPhone = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BUSINESS_PHONE || '+916397321825';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Shri Taxi"
  description="Privacy policy for Shri Taxi — how we collect, use and protect your information when you book a taxi in Dehradun and Uttarakhand."
  canonicalUrl="https://shritaxi.com/privacy-policy"
>
  <TopBar />
  <Header currentPath="/privacy-policy" />
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="legal">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

        <p>
          Shri Taxi ("we", "us", "our") operates <a href="https://shritaxi.com">shritaxi.com</a> and provides taxi
          and tour services in Dehradun and across Uttarakhand. This Privacy Policy explains what information we
          collect when you contact us or book a ride, how we use it, and the choices you have.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
        <p>When you make a booking enquiry through our website, WhatsApp, or phone, we may collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name, phone number, and (optionally) email address.</li>
          <li>Trip details such as pickup point, drop-off point, date, time, vehicle type, and passenger count.</li>
          <li>Any additional notes or preferences you share with us.</li>
          <li>Basic technical information from your browser — IP address, device type, and pages visited — used only to keep the site secure and to understand which content is useful.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not collect payment card data on this website. Payments are settled directly with the driver in cash or via UPI/bank transfer.</p>

        <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your booking enquiry and confirm trip details.</li>
          <li>To provide the taxi service — including sharing the pickup point and contact number with the assigned driver.</li>
          <li>To send service-related messages (booking confirmations, driver details, trip updates) over phone, SMS, or WhatsApp.</li>
          <li>To improve the website and our services.</li>
          <li>To comply with applicable Indian law, including tax and transport regulations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Sharing of information</h2>
        <p>We share your information only with parties that are necessary to fulfil your booking:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Drivers and partner operators</strong> assigned to your trip.</li>
          <li><strong>Service providers</strong> such as Cloudflare (hosting and bot protection via Turnstile), and messaging platforms (WhatsApp, Telegram) we use to coordinate bookings.</li>
          <li><strong>Authorities</strong> if required by law, court order, or to protect our rights or safety.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

        <h2>4. Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          Our site uses minimal cookies — primarily for security (Cloudflare Turnstile) and basic analytics. You can
          disable cookies in your browser; some features such as the booking form may then stop working.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Data retention</h2>
        <p>
          We keep booking enquiries and trip records for as long as needed to provide the service and to meet our
          legal and accounting obligations under Indian law — typically up to 3 years. After that, records are
          deleted or anonymised.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
        <p>You may, at any time, ask us to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Confirm what information we hold about you.</li>
          <li>Correct any information that is inaccurate.</li>
          <li>Delete your information, subject to legal record-keeping requirements.</li>
          <li>Stop sending you marketing messages (we very rarely send any).</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these, contact us using the details below.</p>

        <h2>7. Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable steps to protect the information you share with us. The site is served over HTTPS and
          hosted on Cloudflare's network. No system is perfectly secure, however, and we cannot guarantee absolute
          security.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Children</h2>
        <p>
          Our services are intended for adults (18+). We do not knowingly collect information from children. If you
          believe a child has shared information with us, please contact us so we can delete it.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the
          most recent change. Continued use of our services after a change means you accept the updated policy.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          For any privacy question or request, please reach out to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Phone: <a href={`tel:${businessPhone}`}>{businessPhone}</a></li>
          <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${businessEmail}`}>{businessEmail}</a></li>
          <li>Address: Shri Taxi, Dehradun, Uttarakhand, India.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding: 80px 0 64px;
    background: var(--white);
  }
  .legal .container {
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-size: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin: 32px 0 12px;
  }
  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--teal);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .legal-meta {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
</style>
